     "On 07/07/2014 10:57 AM, Randy B wrote:\r<br>&gt; Hi -- I&#39;m currently running a dual change score model with ordinal data.\r<br>&gt; I&#39;ve specified what variables were ordinal using &quot;ordered =&quot; in the\r<br>&gt; growth() function. In my model syntax, I&#39;ve fixed the variances to be 1\r<br>&gt; since I&#39;m estimating thresholds.\r<br>\r<br>"
